  "Might you be Shinsengumi?": "",
  "A moment? Please?": "",
  "Ya see that!?": "",
  "Look what's goin' down!": "",
  "Could ya put a stop to it?": "",
  "This sorta thing shouldn't be allowed!": "",
  "You could do somethin' about it, couldn't ya?": "",
  "Please!": "",
  "Guess I was foolin' myself.": "",
  "Shinsengumi folk're no help at all.": "",
  "Oh! Hold on!": "",
  "Child-Chasing Mother": "",
  "Where'd you run off to?": "",
  "Mother chasing after her child": "",
  "Made it all the way here...": "",
  "C'mon! Just stay put!": "",
  "Gah! This child!": "",
  "How'd you get so far from me?": "",
  "We havin' stewed fish tonight?": "",
  "Boy": "",
  "Yep, that's the plan.": "",
  "Boy's Mother": "",
  "Yum! I'm excited!": "",
  "Heheh! Better not leave any leftovers, then!": "",
  "No ma'am!": "",
  "Are we havin' mixed rice fer supper?": "",
  "Mm-hmm.": "",
  "Oh boy! I love mixed rice!": "",
  "I'll make it good, so be on your best behavior today.": "",
  "I love stew! Can we have stew tonight?": "",
  "Girl": "",
  "Mm, sure.": "",
  "Girl's Mother": "",
  "You've been a good girl, you deserve it.": "",
  "Whatcha buy, mom?": "",
  "It's a secret...": "",
  "Again? You didn't spend too much, right? Grandma's gonna be upset again!": "",
  "Heehee, good thing we don't have to tell her.": "",
  "Hey, what'd ya get, mom?": "",
  "Tch, don't be so nosey.": "",
  "Aw. I jus' don't want dad to get mad about yer spendin' again!": "",
  "That's why I'm not gonna tell him! And neither are you!": "",
  "Mama, what'd you buy in there?": "",
  "Something good. Something nice.": "",
  "What do ya mean? Is it somethin' ya can't say? Would dad be mad?": "",
  "Dad won't be mad because he won't find out, will he?": "",
  "Well... not if ya buy me somethin' too.": "",
  "'Ey, 'ey! Ma, buy me that!?": "",
  "But why? I just bought you those bubbles earlier.": "",
  "I ain't got 'em no more. I lost 'em.": "",
  "Honestly. What a waste.": "",
  "Aw, I'm sorry. But I'll take good care of whatcha buy me next!": "",
  "Hey, can we get this?": "",
  "Oh, honey, I just bought you that toy windmill.": "",
  "Um, I dropped that somewhere.": "",
  "Really? *sigh* What am I gonna do with you?": "",
  "Sorry, mama.": "",
  "This is so pretty! Can we get this?": "",
  "Do you really need it? I just bought you origami paper.": "",
  "Yeah, but... I folded it all up.": "",
  "*sigh* I wish you'd learn how to make things last.": "",
