  "Over here!": "",
  "C'mon!": "",
  "We're all playin' cards!": "",
  "Eh, I don't wanna.": "",
  "Hey, let's have a race!": "",
  "That came outta nowhere.": "",
  "Hey! Wait up!": "",
  "Hahaha!": "",
  "C'mon an' catch me!": "",
  "Anybody wanna fold origami with me?": "",
  "Nah.": "",
  "I betcha I'm faster'n you!": "",
  "Heck you are! Let's race!": "",
  "C'mon, hurry up!": "",
  "Hey, I got some bubbles!": "",
  "Cool!": "",
  "Eh, bubbles make me sick.": "",
