  "Aw, right now? Fine, I ain't losin'!": "",
  "Mister Saito!": "",
  "Friendly Child": "",
  "C'mon, wait up!": "",
  "You run so fast, mister!": "",
  "My legs're too small!": "",
  "Yay! I caughtcha!": "",
  "I'll always find ya!": "",
  "Hey, carry me on your shoulders, will ya?": "",
  "Aw, he got away.": "",
  "Wait up!": "",
  "No fair, yer too speedy!": "",
  "How do ya get so fast?": "",
  "Hey, I caught up!": "",
  "Come play with me!": "",
  "Hey, what're yer favorite games?": "",
  "Oh, so long!": "",
  "Waaait!": "",
  "Mister, waaait!": "",
  "Ha! So fast!": "",
  "Tag! I gotcha!": "",
  "Hey, don't go nowhere, 'kay?": "",
  "Hey, hey! Gimme a ride on yer back!": "",
  "Aw. See ya!": "",
  "Oi! Gather and listen!": "",
  "Kawaraban Vendor": "",
  "The butcher known as Izo has been apprehended!": "",
  "He was spotted in a gamblin' den and had no chance to flee!": "",
  "May all of Kyo breathe a sigh of relief!": "",
  "Out now! The latest kawaraban! For all the details!": "",
  "In all my life I've never witnessed such an affair!": "",
  "The Shinsengumi raid Ikedaya in the dead of night!": "",
  "And lo! Inside did cavort a hundred shishi!": "",
  "These lawless renegades plotted to set Kyo aflame!": "",
  "Our city, nevermore! Shame upon these scoundrels!": "",
  "The so-called Wolves of Mibu, the Shinsengumi, put a stop to 'em!": "",
  "Out now! Get all the details here!": "",
  "Oi, read it!": "",
  "The Shinsengumi raid Teradaya for our alleged safety!": "",
  "Inside the humble inn did ronin dwell!": "",
  "However! Some claim these ronin served the Bakufu!": "",
  "Yet we've been told the Satsuma and Choshu alliance broker was among 'em!": "",
  "What machinations be at play here!?": "",
  "Afore the raid, a Shinsengumi captain was found dead!": "",
  "Rumor has it he was killed tryin' ta assassinate the Satcho peacemaker!": "",
  "Whose tale carries water!? Oi! To know all, read the kawaraban!": "",
  "The Shinsengumi and the Mimawarigumi were both at the scene!": "",
  "Fer all the stories, search no further!": "",
  "Out now!": "",
  "Oi! Never has information been more valuable!": "",
  "What do y'all know of the Shinsengumi schism!?": "",
  "As their captains continue to drop like flies—": "",
  "Have the Wolves at last divided irreconcilably!?": "",
  "Hear this! Most of the men who once wore blue haori have defected to the Goryo Eji!": "",
  "And what did all 'em fires have ta do with this reckoning!?": "",
  "We've lost homes, businesses, families!": "",
  "And the true culprits be still at large!": "",
  "Oyez! Witness testimony! Oi! Shinsengumi were seen that night!": "",
  "That fire did not merely decimate Kyo! So too were the Shinsengumi left in ruin!": "",
  "Hear this! End of the Bakufu!": "",
  "Imperial rule has been restored to our nation!": "",
  "Three centuries of governmental authority has been undone!": "",
  "Oi! We live in times unprecedented!": "",
  "The Bakufu has fallen! How!? Why!?": "",
  "Could the Satcho Alliance be bellwether of this change!?": "",
  "The Shinsengumi turncoats, the Goryo Eji! Do y'all remember them!?": "",
  "Two of their officers have been found dead! Oi! Cold corpses!": "",
  "One would assume the Shinsengumi struck them down, and yet—": "",
  "Hear this! The Goryo Eji were heretofore plotting ta snuff out the Wolves!": "",
  "Assassination!? Or preemptive attack!?": "",
  "The Satcho peacemaker has been assassinated!": "",
  "Oyez! The man who ended the Bakufu is no more!": "",
  "The site: Omiya!": "",
  "Was the Teradaya raid merely the first, unsuccessful attempt!?": "",
  "Who could be behind this!?": "",
  "Here, here! All the information there is to know! On offer in the kawaraban!": "",
  "Oi! Oi! Gather 'round!": "",
  "A human face on a turtle's shell!": "",
  "Must be seen ta be believed! A turtle shell with the face of a man!": "",
  "Read about this peculiarity now!": "",
  "Follow Kamo River north and discover the curious portent fer yerself!": "",
  "Can ya truly claim to've lived if ya miss out on such an opportunity!?": "",
  "What's more! The face upon the shell speaks human words!": "",
  "Learn all! Here, in the latest kawaraban! Available now!": "",
  "Why, I'll even tell ya how ta capture the sucker!": "",
  "Know you of the inimitable philanderer Gohei!?": "",
  "Off to Edo he's gone, to the Yoshiwara pleasure district!": "",
  "Hear this! So smitten was he by a depiction of a courtesan there!": "",
  "With nary a second thought, clutched he a travel pass and went off!": "",
  "Oi, and yet! So libertine, Gohei—": ""
